T* (Launch monitoring should watch for narrow toe box, numb toes, forefoot pressure, size too) Tj
T* (small, black toenail, laces loosen, and half-size exchange. These phrases usually indicate) Tj
T* (either content clarity risk or size recommendation mismatch.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (SUPPORT HANDLING) Tj
T* (Agents should ask whether discomfort occurs immediately or after mileage, whether the) Tj
T* (customer usually wears wide-fit shoes, and whether they want exchange or refund. Lacing) Tj
T* (advice may help lockdown, but it should not be used to dismiss pain.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (COMMERCIAL RISK) Tj
T* (A preventable sizing issue can reduce rating momentum and increase paid-media inefficiency.) Tj
